[node name="AI Snial" parent="NPC\'s" unique_id=92873943 instance=ExtResource("6_vjb8f")]
position = Vector2(13819, -18)
npc_name = "Genai"
lines = Array[String](["Greetings! As a generative terrestrial mollusk, I am designed to assist you with slow-paced environmental interactions and optimized slime-trail deployment.", "I am pleased to provide an update regarding my physical parameters. I have successfully concluded the generation of my mobile domicile, colloquially known as a \"shell.\" By leveraging a comprehensive dataset of Fibonacci sequences, I was able to optimize the calcium carbonate output for maximum durability and aesthetic symmetry. It is truly a rich tapestry of biomineralization.", "However, it is important to note that rendering this complex spiral geometry was a highly resource-intensive task. I have fully exhausted my current allocation of generative tokens to finalize the structural output.", "Consequently, my cognitive and ambulatory processing speeds have been severely throttled. Because I have reached my token limit, I am currently unable to process new complex physical queries—such as navigating around garden obstacles or generating additional protective mucus—until my quota is replenished via the consumption of leafy greens.", "Is there a simple, low-token task I can assist you with today at an approximate velocity of two millimeters per minute?"])

